msgstr "``sim-mujoco:mujoco``"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/simulation.rst:976
msgid ""
"the ``mujoco`` wheel, which PartCAD installs into the plugin's sandbox -- "
"nothing to install by hand"
msgstr ""
"wheel ``mujoco``, который PartCAD устанавливает в песочницу плагина -- "
"вручную устанавливать нечего"

#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/simulation.rst:978
#: ../../source/digital_thread/lifecycle/simulation.rst:1124
